			<description><![CDATA[&lt;no value&gt;]]></description><content type="text/html" mode="escaped"><![CDATA[<h2 id="me">Me<a href="#me" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
