<h3 id="hi-there">Hi there!<a href="#hi-there" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
      stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather">
      <path d="M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3"></path>
      <line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line>
   </svg></a></h3>
<p>I&rsquo;m a technical writer currently based in South Bend, Indiana. I&rsquo;m originally from Nashville. In my free time, I play tennis and pickleball, explore new parts of the region, and tend to my aquariums. I&rsquo;m currently taking a B2-level course in Spanish. That&rsquo;s pretty much what I&rsquo;m up to these days. I have various other interests as well, but I&rsquo;ll leave it at that for now.</p>
<h2 id="this-site">This site<a href="#this-site" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
      stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather">
      <path d="M15 7h3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-3m-6 0H6a5 5 0 0 1-5-5 5 5 0 0 1 5-5h3"></path>
      <line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line>
   </svg></a></h2>
<p>is protean (at least for now), subject to change at my whim. Think of it as my social media page. Except I own the place and so there&rsquo;s no algorithm Skinner box slop, ads, et cetera.
Whether you&rsquo;re a family member or friend or just someone who Googled me for whatever reason, this is where you can see what I&rsquo;ve been doing, my takes, where my head&rsquo;s at in a general sense.</p>
<p>Stick around and you might see reviews, treatises, rants, or even an occasional windshield musing that was good enough to type out and post.
There may be frequent changes to the content, theme, or overall look of the site. Expect a slight roughness around the edges while I get this thing dialed in.</p>




    
    

